// BT-3702: ADR 0130 Phase 0 gate 4. Instance-side `on:do:` in a loop, run
// outside any class invocation (the protected block never raises), so the
// snapshot/restore pair of the new lowering would be a pass-through.

Value subclass: SsbOnDoObject

  run: n :: Integer -> Integer =>
    1 to: n do: [:i | [i + 1] on: Error do: [:e | 0]]
    n
